uto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dcdb0754b2e2957a6da7835796b7e34d 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！あなたの作る音楽は素晴らしい！\n私は音楽のことはよく知らないので、あなたの創造力に任せますが、その音楽の基になったキャラクターを紹介しましょう！\n彼らはとても内気で社交的ではなく、多くの人と話すことができない。少し神経質だが、友人たちにとっては、最も無私で、思いやりがあり、いい人だ。また、非常に頭が良く、科学の多くの分野に精通しており、それを使ってテクノロジーを作ることも多い！また、ピアノも弾ける！\n彼らの生い立ちは過酷で、邪悪な人々に育てられた......しかし、ギビーは脱走し、世界を助け、人々の生活を向上させることを誓う！優しい心\n\n私が求めているのは戦闘の歌です。誰かが友人を傷つけ、彼らはその知性のすべてを駆使して相手を倒し、核となる優しさを失う！それはとても脅威的で、たくさんのテクノロジーを使っている。テンポの速い戦闘！\n\n多分、アーメンブレイクか、彼らの素敵な自己のヒントが散りばめられている！ピアノとか？\nでも本当に、あなたが一番合っていると思うもの、あなたにとっていいと思うものをやってください！\n\nhttps://toyhou.se/24562168.gibby/gallery", "nc": 8, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tirimen_tirimen/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3032751, "client_id": 1097156, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70b91a93036c5fda69b324f9bb4bb413", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70b91a93036c5fda69b324f9bb4bb413, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53ffd02fe10f71d6ca6b4a82a2235c45 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52fc662709afa625651786d95e12288a 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/43e8cc73-0b11-44ff-8bd8-f0716f69af59?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1780466694&Signature=JE6lyBkIHcXKnvXWqTn7o-sv1MxDaFUnh-Y3B87cXrOeZH8Q-no4ZNdkYS0LGYYiVAlDsySfbmlPHj2~WaO1X7pe2y4E09uGbiDQpxnCzkJd4ZYtG1clzjCzoMwNlEf2XE6W43qkwbF78SPurQs2y3rZdm5urwJhQ7IFcI1cl5Z2gpQBie3aomHAM~bVwj2td9-ltJp9a8hlackm~u1uE3G6jFuAdew9LJEWtwOkDKnS6u5PusXlI76VTEE7~Rf~L3aFtIhHbzWHiSZr8MVSykNoXj2VAY2A~toB-I568s3CcM3onI-5U9D6gicYtK8xeWD5Te9GzPZalMX9I7FbSw__&Key-Pair-Id=K1GS3H53SEO647", "duration": 93, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=762dd430168bf5f8c79f50a33b3ff4af", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=762dd430168bf5f8c79f50a33b3ff4af, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=33f9b93a6118b79c23401df8e420aaed 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dcdb0754b2e2957a6da7835796b7e34d 3x"}, "body": "Hi!\n\nMay I request an instrumental song, please? I heard the previous track from you and I'd love one as well!\n\nThe motif of the song is for a story I'm working on and I'd love to listen to the track while writing. The story is of a heroine trapped in a tragic time loop, and where she always loses someone she cares for. She's hunting for a way to escape.\n\nThe following are inspiration tracks I often listen to in order of closest to the sound I'd like to least!:\n\n1) https://youtu.be/Rm1jC0u6zSs?si=Bw5CbhYTnsa1EszM\n2) https://youtu.be/ZkCUJ80cuxo?si=VbhB3XT6yLgryLsV\n3) https://youtu.be/TGBf4-_8gYI?si=OyYeCpxIE02Py2Kn\n4) https://youtu.be/0aBrOwGSm0c?si=aJnPaEAA5GHhDk52\n5) https://youtu.be/dX9gvYi7PJ4?si=TsGDULuNqnMhgbZt\n6) https://youtu.be/ZE7jhyC-skg?si=C9amt50TmaGjF0Qs\n\nThank you for considering my request!", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "audio", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tirimen_tirimen/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "music", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 3032751, "client_id": 1774207, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70b91a93036c5fda69b324f9bb4bb413", "srcset": "https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=70b91a93036c5fda69b324f9bb4bb413, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=53ffd02fe10f71d6ca6b4a82a2235c45 2x, https://skeb-avatar.imgix.net/https%3A%2F%2Fpbs.twimg.com%2Fprofile_images%2F1774745594818695168%2FxutNWD3n.jpg?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=52fc662709afa625651786d95e12288a 3x"}, "preview_url": "https://fcdn.skeb.jp/uploads/outputs/891c8a28-3158-47c0-9ffb-d6395c6aa42e?response-content-disposition=inline&Expires=1780466694&Signature=DwhWFja7vPM5mQTYzeGjK7EGH7lt~hmmzKkLXBcItKu1VMc7SfQ~riMnvXYgBT8p-NDKprYuWFmNkBwca~R-cD54NqKbClfLxlpAOxE2HdAMQLApg2S46Q5HvismlePdTccujd14J1R9pTJLou1LK3j29xMHEd9l-A9a6Ro8i701vop1PLsdSq1Kd1ilFbGxikBQcP8WaRqvmCZqD~7sgIQYZUMlE1GAGk7IK~8KJa9Pv3RM6IU6ovhgyshQeNDU7XTdeCPS4qNb~Dk9f4nluWW3W6qSc1wqJGt5zfSsos9qHcdzp6-Bq07TwBN9zNt1LXRC6oGtEhY7YH8esAsUrQ__&Ke